The my355 binary is rebuilt here against Apostrophe. It opens
InputPlumber's virtual Xbox 360 pad through SDL GameController and
does not write cpufreq. zlyme-governor owns the clocks. Stock
Apostrophe treats the Flip as keyboard scancodes; this image's
production PAKs do not see that device.
ScreenScraper developer credentials are the same ones baked into the
upstream 2.3.0 release binary.
